{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310","id":6025105121,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFVR088AAAABZx_O4Q","number":310,"title":"[消息队列 MQ02] 多个消费者：分工处理，还是每人一份？","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:40:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- message-queue-series:2026-10-25:mq02 -->\n\n**核心顺序2/9；MQ02仅作稳定题库索引。待定稿，未开拍。** 拟为独立视频及配套图文，无观看硬前置。\n\n## 独立问题与主线\n\n通知服务和积分服务都需要完整订单事件，为什么接到同一个队列后，可能各自只拿到一部分？\n\n1. 本片自行介绍订单事件、Exchange、Queue和消费者；先让两个不同服务消费同一队列，沿三条带eventId的事件显示它们如何分工。\n2. 明确业务目标是两个服务都拿到全部事件，改为fanout Exchange路由到两个独立队列，再逐条追踪同一事件进入两条路径。\n3. 在通知服务内部再增加一个实例：服务内继续竞争分工，两个服务仍各自拥有完整事件，闭合“分工还是广播”的问题。\n\n观众带走的结论：收到几份由订阅拓扑决定，消费者数量本身不会把同一队列变成广播。本片只讲分发归属，不展开确认协议、重试或Kafka位点。\n\n## 专项对照验收\n\n以相同输入事件从同一初始状态分别演示“一个队列、两个服务”与“两个队列、各自服务”。核对每条eventId的归属与收到数量；增加服务内实例后，不能把同一队列的分工误画成每个实例各收到一份。两种拓扑切换时明确重置前提。\n\n## 边界与资料\n\n固定RabbitMQ Exchange/Queue模型，必要的fanout规则在本片说明；RabbitMQ Streams不在本例范围。独立队列只建立独立消费路径，不自动保证持久化、离线保留或业务成功；教程临时队列配置也不能直接当作生产可靠性方案。D02仍以观察者模式为主体，不因关联扩大其MQ篇幅。\n\n- [RabbitMQ Publish/Subscribe](https://www.rabbitmq.com/tutorials/tutorial-three-python)：fanout与独立订阅队列。\n- [RabbitMQ Queues](https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/queues)：竞争消费、队列与消费者关系。\n\n公共制作与验收规范统一见[总览#308](https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/308)。正式制作固定Broker、客户端与队列配置，专项验收不预先标为完成。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/310/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}